It looks like you still have a better AK than some of my characters ever 
had. The biggest loss you have is the BoH. If I were you, I'd do ever 
more to help the ascension run; dig out paths between stairs, make 
stashes of food or other things you might need at the downstairs 
occasionally, etc. In that time you'll probably encounter some decent 
loot to help you back on your feet. Also, go back to any stores and make 
sure there's nothing left behind that you could use now (such as rings 
that were originally redundant).

I would probably use the (80% chance of a wish) for a ring of conflict 
or levitation, if neither of those are found or poly'd. YMMV.


